---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ColitisHelpUSA.com"
  description="Privacy policy for ColitisHelpUSA.com — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="/privacy-policy"
>
  <main class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: #0B2545">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm mb-6" style="color: #5C5C56">Last updated: 2025</p>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: #5C5C56">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2" style="color: #0B2545">Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit a form on this website, we collect the information you provide — including your name, email address, phone number, state, and responses to health-related questions. We also collect non-personal information such as browser type, referring pages, and general geographic region through standard analytics tools.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2" style="color: #0B2545">How we use your information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used to send educational resources, provide care-navigation guidance, and, where you have given consent, share your information with selected healthcare partners or care-navigation services. We do not sell your data to unrelated third parties.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2" style="color: #0B2545">Consent and sharing</h2>
        <p>By submitting a form on this website and checking the consent checkbox, you agree that your information may be shared with selected care-navigation or healthcare partners as described in our consent language and Partner Disclosure. Consent is required only to receive personalized care-navigation outreach — you can use this website without submitting any form.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2" style="color: #0B2545">Your rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to request that we delete your information or opt you out of partner communications. To exercise these rights, contact us at the email listed below.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2" style="color: #0B2545">Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions or requests, contact us at: privacy@colitishelpusa.com</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
